OL,3,ASotheby's auction of $180m Van Gogh
OL,4,Achallenged over claims it was 'sold
OL,5,Aunder duress'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSotheby's says its own "extensive
OL,8,Fresearch" has not established this, but
OL,9,Fthat it will work with the family to
OL,10,Ftry and reach a solution.
